        "original_id": "749ad0ee-1671-5fdc-b171-890fc0d03037",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Central Maine and Quebec Railway\n- Places: Rockland Railroad Station, Maine, Vermont, Quebec, New York\n- Topics: rail line leasing, rail service restoration, freight rail operations\n\nFacts:\n- The line associated with Rockland Railroad Station has been leased to the Central Maine and Quebec Railway.\n- The Central Maine and Quebec Railway plans to reintroduce service on the leased line.\n- The Central Maine & Québec Railway, reporting mark CMQ, is a Class III freight railroad.\n- The Central Maine & Québec Railway operates in the U.S. states of Maine and Vermont and in the Canadian province of Quebec.\n- The Central Maine & Québec Railway is headquartered in New York, New York.",
